Group 07 Gbagyi Indigenous Language AI Benchmark

This Pull Request contains the complete Group 07 Gbagyi submission for CSC 406 Assignment 1.

Deliverables

- Gbagyi raw corpus in JSONL format
- Cleaned and tokenized Gbagyi corpus
- Custom Unicode-aware tokenizer
- Gbagyi stop-word analysis
- Zipf's Law rank-frequency analysis
- Unigram and Bigram language models
- Add-1/Laplace smoothing
- Perplexity evaluation against the instructor-provided unseen Gbagyi test set
- Jupyter Notebook
- Python implementation
- Group report
- Zipf rank-frequency visualization

