Data Provenance

The corpus was collected programmatically from authentic publicly accessible Gbagyi-language sources using Python requests and BeautifulSoup, with provenance documented in the notebook/report.

Reproducibility

The implementation uses the assignment-approved Python dependencies and implements the required preprocessing, Zipf analysis, and Bigram language model from scratch.

Integrity

The instructor's unseen test file was not used as training data and was not modified.
